  "thig1.9:0.3": "9. 9. Bhadrātherīgāthā ",
  "thig1.9:1.1": "‘‘Saddhāya pabbajitvāna, ",
  "thig1.9:1.2": "bhadre bhadraratā bhava; ",
  "thig1.9:1.3": "Bhāvehi kusale dhamme, ",
  "thig1.9:1.4": "yogakkhemamanuttara’’nti. … ",
  "thig1.9:2.1": "Bhadrā therī…. "
